OL,3,GNEWSAYouths caught trespassing on
OL,4,Aclosed school grounds
OL,5,
OL,6,FYouths wearing balaclavas were caught
OL,7,Ftrespassing on the grounds of a closed
OL,8,Fprivate school, police have said.
OL,10,FThe six people were attempting to gain
OL,11,Fentry through a window at Leweston
OL,12,FSchool, near Sherborne, on Thursday
OL,13,Fafternoon, Dorset Police said.
OL,15,FOfficers attended and located the
OL,16,Fyouths before contacting their parents
OL,17,For guardians, who then came to collect
OL,18,Fthem. One was taken home by police.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
